<p style="margin:0; text-align:center; line-height:0;"><img src="https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg724b63244550007/dronebox2/web/upload/NNEditor/20261026/4c311d74a5975707995d66fee597ef86.jpg" alt="DJI Dock 4 내부 배터리 교체부" style="max-width:100%; width:100%; display:block; margin:0 auto;"></p>
<p style="font-size:14px; color:#4E5968; margin:0 0 6px;">DJI 정품 판매점 <b>드론박스</b> · Dock 4 · Matrice 5TD 전용</p><h2 style="font-size:24px; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 12px; color:#191F28;">DJI 매트리스 5TD 배터리 Matrice 5TD Series Battery (Dock 4)</h2><div style="height:12px;"></div>
<div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Article" style="margin:0 0 8px; padding:24px 20px 10px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; border-radius:12px; background:#FFFFFF;"><h3 itemprop="headline" style="font-size:21px; font-weight:700; margin:32px 0 14px; padding-bottom:8px; border-bottom:2px solid #E3E6EB; color:#191F28; margin-top:0;">DJI Matrice 5TD 배터리</h3><div itemprop="articleBody"><p style="font-size:15px; color:#333D4B; margin:0 0 10px; line-height:1.75;">DJI Dock 4와 Matrice 5TD에 쓰는 정품 인텔리전트 배터리입니다. Dock 4는 착륙 후 25초 안에 이 배터리를 자동으로 바꿔 끼웁니다.</p><p style="font-size:15px; color:#333D4B; margin:0 0 10px; line-height:1.75;">도크 수납함 4칸 중 최대 3칸에 배터리를 넣을 수 있고 2개를 동시에 충전합니다. 수납된 배터리는 정전 때 도크 백업 전원(배터리당 약 4.5시간)으로도 쓰입니다.</p></div></div>
<div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Article" style="margin:0 0 8px; padding:24px 20px 10px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; border-radius:12px; background:#FFFFFF;"><h3 itemprop="headline" style="font-size:21px; font-weight:700; margin:32px 0 14px; padding-bottom:8px; border-bottom:2px solid #E3E6EB; color:#191F28; margin-top:0;">사양 (DJI 공식)</h3><div itemprop="articleBody"><div style="overflow-x:auto;"><table style="border-collapse:collapse; width:100%;">
<tr><th style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; text-align:left; font-weight:700; vertical-align:top; width:34%;">호환</th><td style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28; vertical-align:top;">DJI Matrice 5TD · DJI Dock 4 배터리 수납함</td></tr>
<tr><th style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; text-align:left; font-weight:700; vertical-align:top; width:34%;">용량 · 전압</th><td style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28; vertical-align:top;">12138mAh · 21.42V (최대 충전 25.8V)</td></tr>
<tr><th style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; text-align:left; font-weight:700; vertical-align:top; width:34%;">에너지 · 무게</th><td style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28; vertical-align:top;">260Wh · 925g</td></tr>
<tr><th style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; text-align:left; font-weight:700; vertical-align:top; width:34%;">셀 · 화학</th><td style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28; vertical-align:top;">Li-ion 6S · LiNiMnCoO2</td></tr>
<tr><th style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; text-align:left; font-weight:700; vertical-align:top; width:34%;">충전 사이클</th><td style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28; vertical-align:top;">400회 (35°C 넘는 곳 누적 보관 연 100일 이하 조건)</td></tr>
